<chapter xml:id="ch08_soccer_competition_cargo_sorting" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Lab: Soccer Competition &amp; Cargo Sorting</title>
  <introduction>
    <p>This chapter is a capstone lab chapter that brings together kinematics, path planning, reactive avoidance, and vision-based classification from earlier chapters into two applied challenges: a soccer competition and a cargo-sorting task. Rather than introduce new theory, the chapter focuses on integrating existing subsystems into robust, time-pressured robot behavior. By the end, you should be able to design a state machine that sequences perception, decision-making, and action for a competitive or task-driven robotics scenario.</p>
  </introduction>
